# Keep every checkout byte-identical across platforms.
#
# This matters more here than in most repositories: `README.i18n.yaml` and
# `CHANGELOG.i18n.yaml` record the git blob hash of each language side, and that
# hash is computed from the file's exact bytes. With `core.autocrlf=true` a
# Windows checkout would rewrite the line endings, every recorded hash would stop
# matching, and `npm test` would report the documentation as edited when nobody
# touched it. Forcing LF makes the check platform-independent.
* text=auto eol=lf

# The banner is an image. Never touch its bytes.
docs/banner.png binary
